Give oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Traces the CalcMedicalCost results that TacticalAI/NPC.cc uses (OracleTracedMedicalCost, defined in Oracle.cc) and appends
OracleNPCConsiderReceivingItemFromMerc, a wrapper around the static NPCConsiderReceivingItemFromMerc that reports the chosen
record index and the record the result points to. In Tactical/Handle_Items.cc, SoldierGiveItemFromAnimation calls
InitiateConversationFull, EnterShopKeeperInterfaceScreen and AddItemToPlayersOfferAreaAfterShopKeeperOpen through
OracleGiveConversation, OracleGiveShop and OracleGiveOffer (Oracle.cc), which forward to the real functions unless a give
probe is running. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0014.

